!.mastracode/commands/stackdash-migrate.md
!.mastracode/commands/stackdash-migrate/
!.mastracode/stackdash-workflow-builder/
# out-of-scope design assets (other pages / full gallery) stay local-only; the Tdarr run
# only needs the tdarr screenshots + the requirements doc tracked.
.mastracode/stackdash-workflow-builder/Dashboard Design/
.mastracode/stackdash-workflow-builder/downloads-*.png
.mastracode/stackdash-workflow-builder/overview-*.png
